{"id":"0a280d5aaff0f54d","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-grade-reduction.md","title":"Grade Reduction Lemma","display":"lem-grade-reduction — Grade Reduction Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-grade-reduction","aliases":["72-lem-grade-reduction"],"display":"lem-grade-reduction — Grade Reduction Lemma","depends_on":["[[72-thm-hauptsatz]]","[[72-df-cut-degree]]","[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-gentzen-system]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I Theorem2.4.2 print37/PDF49; §3.1.1 print65/PDF77; direct existence corollary","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_23":"消切与恒等展开的适用演算现在显式包含α改名；保留来源证明限制"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-grade-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-grade-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-grade-reduction — Grade Reduction Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b47d324b259bbefc\" href=\"?note=b47d324b259bbefc\" title=\"72-thm-hauptsatz\">72-thm-hauptsatz</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"715dbcdaf4fc3a32\" href=\"?note=715dbcdaf4fc3a32\" title=\"72-df-cut-degree\">72-df-cut-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I Theorem2.4.2 print37/PDF49; §3.1.1 print65/PDF77; direct existence corollary"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23","html":"消切与恒等展开的适用演算现在显式包含α改名；保留来源证明限制"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a> 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的有限五元带标签证明集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in\\{\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)&gt;0\">\\(d=\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)&gt;0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi&#39;)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi&#39;)&lt;d).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\pi&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi&#39;)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\land\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi&#39;)&lt;d).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>作为存在性命题直接由完整Hauptsatz得到更强的CutDeg(π′)=0，再将基础演算证明看作含Cut演算证明。此论证没有声称给出了逐步选择最大切的局部终止算法；后者需要独立的归约细节。</p>\n<p>2026-10-23：本结论使用现行演算中的显式α改名。有限证明中可将所有绑定变量改到与自由变量不交的新鲜储备，规整本征变量，再按原书两类变量进行消切；译回原端相继式允许最后一次α改名。任意公式恒等初始式先作结构展开，不能把它按零成本原子初始式代入原书定量界。旧版没有α规则时相同的无条件消切断言不成立，见本轮的捕获反例。来源完整归约及终止证明仍未机器重建。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-hauptsatz","status":"resolved","id":"b47d324b259bbefc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-hauptsatz]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-cut-degree","status":"resolved","id":"715dbcdaf4fc3a32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-cut-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma$ 均取 [[72-df-gentzen-system]] 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。$\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C$ 是 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的有限五元带标签证明集合。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","i